{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/Gif_02.gif?t=1752843745\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/Store_Title_01_English.png?t=1752843745\" /></div>Particle Hearts is a 3rd-person adventure game where you explore a world made entirely of particles.  Use special abilities to manipulate those particles, solve puzzles, avoid detection, and navigate this sinister and beautiful land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/Gif_03.gif?t=1752843745\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/Store_Title_02_English.png?t=1752843745\" /></div>Along the way, meet various creatures, some of which will help you understand your purpose and others who are tasked with hiding it from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/Gif_01.gif?t=1752843745\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/Store_Title_03_English.png?t=1752843745\" /></div>Collect memories, find hidden paths, and piece together your connection to this land that isn\u2019t always what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/Gif_05.gif?t=1752843745\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/Store_Title_04_English.png?t=1752843745\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Gain multiple abilities that allow you to manipulate the particles around you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Use your abilities to solve puzzles, evade enemies, and gain access to hidden areas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Freely explore open environments any way you\u2019d like.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0  Experience a story where the line between friend and foe is often blurred.  Meet various creatures that help you unravel your purpose in this land.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/Gif_04.gif?t=1752843745\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/extras/Store_Title_05_English.png?t=1752843745\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2074740?t=1752843745","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752843745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/513f19350bb5b0f105122c91d83a79538785698d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752843745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074740/513f19350bb5b0f105122c91d83a79538785698d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752843745","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":